          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, ĩvinda yaendeea myaka ĩlĩ yathela, maa make metĩkanga kwondũ wa ũwau wake, na akw’a nĩ mowau me woo mũno. Na andũ make matyaamũtoeesya, o tondũ matoeeasya aaĩthe make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
